{{!-- A1, "List": one wide row per post, from the row every List Surface shares.

The list runs to the page width, so the rows line up with the masthead above them, the filter
bar's pills, and the pagination below — no `--container-max` override here, just the page's own
`container`.

The row itself is `archive/list-row.hbs`, which the tag archive and a writer's archive also draw:
`@custom.feed_layout` is one setting, so _List_ is one row wherever posts are listed. Everything
that used to live here moved there unchanged. --}}
<section
	aria-label="{{t "Posts"}}"
	class="container pt-2">
	{{#foreach posts}}
		{{> "archive/list-row"}}
	{{else}}
		<p class="font-body text-muted py-11">{{t "No posts yet."}}</p>
	{{/foreach}}
</section>
